ok   feedShelves: titles, per-channel and mixed groups, shorts shelf dropped, per-shelf dedup, meta, caps
ok   thumbs: cached thumb.rgba by its length, else thumbs/<id>.rgba, else the helper (env {}, cwd /), checked, kept, 150 at most
